Interview Techniques: Explanation and Best Practices\par
\par
Interview techniques refer to the strategies, approaches, and skills used during the hiring process to evaluate candidates effectively. These techniques help interviewers assess the skills, experience, and personality of potential employees while ensuring a fair and smooth interview process.\par
